design and furnish your rooms. Choose styles, color schemes, equipments and decorations to create a unique atmosphere and get the maximum revenue possible. Keep your shop shelves full of products that travellers might need.\n\nDesign your rooms (floor, walls and roof) and furnish them, keep them clean to satisfy your customers. You will have a lot of choices so bring your creative ideas to life.\n\nProvide every product you can. Order, stock in warehouse and keep track of the prices to make profit. Design your shop as you wish and keep it clean, otherwise customers will leave immediately. Place different shelves and fridges inside your shop and keep them full.\n\nHigh popularity means more customers and high rating means happy to pay customers. Make sure you serve them in time and provide every thing they need. Customers are always right.\n\nAt some point you will not be able to run everything by yourself. Cash register, fuel pump, cleaning, motel check in/out and shelf filling are a lot of work. But don't worry, you can build a staff room and hire people to help you with all of it. But you will have to do the management and be the boss.\n\nOrder shipments of products/equipment and every thing you need run your motel. Set prices for shop products and room renting. Give your employees assignments and make sure you're paying them.\n\nExpand your business to serve more customers and make more profit, three fuel pumps are better than just one as long as there are customers to serve, so make sure to invest in the right place.\n\nyou can add a lot of ideas to your motel, such as payphones and vending machines to make more money. Or build a bus station to attract more customers. You can even place ads in your motel area to generate more cash (if you have the required popularity).\nKey Features\n\n•  Renovate, clean, furnish and expand an abandoned motel.\n\n•  Design your rooms and equip them and make them ready to accept guests.\n\n•  Order shipments, fill shelves with different products.\n\n•  Hire employees to help you in your journey.\n\n•  Manage your stock, prices and upgrade your work places.\n\n•  Serve customers and keep them satisfied.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594540/header.jpg?t=1752541428"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752541428"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594540/ss_3485a7e0c993f66f8bcaea70392f8f209916f9b2.600x338.jpg?t=1752541428","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594540/ss_3485a7e0c993f66f8bcaea70392f8f209916f9b2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752541428"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594540/ss_22c1e93dcef2e94c0ce7efe91f83f9380aa421b0.600x338.jpg?t=1752541428","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594540/ss_22c1e93dcef2e94c0ce7efe91f83f9380aa421b0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752541428"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594540/ss_8989f811a930c8c53fdf72b7737b0656a3ffc140.600x338.jpg?t=1752541428","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594540/ss_8989f811a930c8c53fdf72b7737b0656a3ffc140.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752541428"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594540/ss_d0226d5fb6be28deabab73ab62e7f2b444bfcfe9.600x338.jpg?t=1752541428","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594540/ss_d0226d5fb6be28deabab73ab62e7f2b444bfcfe9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752541428"},{"id":4,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/